  More of Nethack's D&D heritage.  In D&D, whenever a major physical 
type of magic was performed on your character (like polymorphing, 
resurrecting, etc.), there was a small chance (inversely proportional
to your constitution, I believe) that you'd die of system shock.  
Same thing in Nethack, although I don't think that Amulets of Life
Saving require a system shock throw (maybe they should, though).
